flowchart TD
  subgraph client[Browser boundary]
    U[User] --> UI[React UI]
  end
  subgraph backend[Backend boundary]
    ROUTE[Protected chat route] --> SERVICE[ChatService]
    SERVICE --> FLOW[chat_workflow]
    FLOW --> C[CloudAgent]
    C --> A[AWSAuditor allowlist]
    A -->|normalized findings and incomplete checks| C
    C -->|AuditReport| R[RagService]
    R -->|retrieved attributed guidance| CO[ComplianceAgent]
    CO -->|untrusted generated assessment| S[SeniorAgent]
    S -->|review text| SERVICE
    SERVICE -->|completed assessment| DB[(Assessment storage)]
    DB --> GET[Protected assessment read routes]
    STORE[(Trusted FAISS and pickle metadata)] --> R
  end
  UI -->|JWT, prompt and bounded history| ROUTE
  A -->|read-only signed requests| AWS[AWS API boundary]
  AWS -->|resource evidence or errors| A
  C <-->|tool selection| MODEL[External inference trust boundary]
  CO <-->|audit evidence and guidance / text| MODEL
  S <-->|report and compliance text / review| MODEL
  SERVICE -->|live response with citations| UI
  GET -->|saved report without RAG citations| UI
